# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
# Your Anthropic API key — used server-side only, never exposed to the browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Supabase service role key — server-only. Required: all DB access is brokered
# through authenticated API routes using this key (the browser holds no key).
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Optional: override the built-in Supabase project URL.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co

# Web Push (optional but recommended) — lets the server notify your phone when a
# summary/translation finishes even with the app closed. Generate a pair with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('web-push').generateVAPIDKeys())"
# Put the private key here (server-only). A default public key ships in the code;
# only set NEXT_PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY if you rotate to your own pair.
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com
